  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): same \"closed-set check missing between writer stages\" cluster as INV-mozaf (1198 discovery vs 902 emitted) and INV-nuzas (workspace symbols collapsed to <external> placeholder). metrics.compute_metrics (metrics.py:102-108) buckets dangling-src edges to `unknown` tier, exposing the gap but not validating it. The 8-of-23 function-node origins in the existing pass-13 discussion confirm the filter boundary is generated/tested-generated, not file/function. A post-emit `assert set(e.src for e in edges) <= set(n.id for n in nodes)` would catch all three."  # 2815
